	(text "2 per tap AHEAD of the fuse (AC10 pulse-rated, 20 R = the smallest E24 value inside AX-01 / 02: hot-plug I2t 18.1 % of the fuse melting I2t (rule 20 %), film surge 1218 V); 4.64 W each at the highest input current (0.48 A, 250 V)\nFuse: (30 W case, unchanged) per-port fuse 1000 VDC gPV behind 44R: fault current <= 25 A (breaking 20 kA not needed), hot-plug I2t 0.091 A2s = 16 % of melting"
